    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063750/extras/d34dcdf5346f502d7d648aad257d4132.avif?t=1748434483\" width=616 height=346 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>With core gameplay of multiplayer cooperative dungeon combat, upgrade Battle Talent's combat thrills, this co-op game brings you into VR Minecraft world to explore the unknown\uff01Designed around player exploration and social experiences.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd4cFour Level Dungeons, Explore like Minecraft</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Maps</strong>: Every run is fresh, with traps &amp; treasure boxes. Look out for box monster, don't be eaten!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Library, Dungeon, Ruins</strong> - endless places to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play With Friends</strong>: Throw apples, play games - goof around for max fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063750/extras/3fab8c74865efec560eab3066c651e32.poster.avif?t=1748434483\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063750/extras/3fab8c74865efec560eab3066c651e32.webm?t=1748434483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063750/extras/3fab8c74865efec560eab3066c651e32.mp4?t=1748434483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5Epic Boss Battles, 2nd Stage Power-Up</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Bosses</strong>: <strong>Skull King, Ghost Lord, Angel, God of Time</strong>. Fight them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Boss Skills!</strong> Skull King swings his axe, little skulls run to attack you. Ghost Lord uses explosions &amp; shoots bullets that chase you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Second Stage</strong>: Angel becomes giant eye monster &amp; fires deadly lasers. God of Time smashes the ground &amp; sends everyone into 2nd battlefield - battles upgrade so exciting!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063750/extras/6c786f456494b46224b6ffdd96523310.poster.avif?t=1748434483\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063750/extras/6c786f456494b46224b6ffdd96523310.webm?t=1748434483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063750/extras/6c786f456494b46224b6ffdd96523310.mp4?t=1748434483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0fRich Weapons</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw shields like Captain America! Slash with Wolverine\u2019s claws! Shoot like Hawkeye!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katana, wands</strong>... melee or ranged attacks, so many weapons to pick!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063750/extras/acec53cb10f643caf0fe06a2b64443c9.poster.avif?t=1748434483\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063750/extras/acec53cb10f643caf0fe06a2b64443c9.webm?t=1748434483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063750/extras/acec53cb10f643caf0fe06a2b64443c9.mp4?t=1748434483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Upgrade</strong>: refresh weapon stats to upgrade. Turn single hits into combos &amp; power up!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See a treasure box?</strong> Open for random rare weapon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>BOSS Weapons</strong> to fight bosses and feel boss-level power!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Up Talent Tree</strong>: Focus on quick dodges or strong attacks? Both offer unique battle experiences!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc51Create Your Hero</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Witcher, Black Knight, Bird Man...classic &amp; creative heroes to choose!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
